+GRANTED, resource-scoped wherever GCP allows it — narrower than a project-wide grant, same
+principle already applied to `run.invoker` on this service account (#39 review round 1, "RESOURCE-
+scoped, not project-scoped… would let it invoke every Cloud Run resource in the project"):
