+# in deploy/nightly/README.md, never by CI. `build:nightly-image` builds with kaniko and never
+# invokes `gcloud` at all, so this file has ZERO effect on what CI ships; `.dockerignore` is the
+# only guard on that path. An earlier version of this file's own comment claimed otherwise —
+# round-1 review of the kaniko redesign (cto-reviewer + platform-reviewer, opus) caught the
+# stale model. Read `.dockerignore`'s header before touching either file.
+#
